EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh, hey! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Did you know I was going
to be here, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}? The more
the merrier, I say, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh, ehi! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sapevi che sarei stata qui
anch'io, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}? Evviva!
Più siamo, meglio è, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Aa, selam! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Burada olacağımı biliyor
muydun, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}? Ne kadar kalabalık,
o kadar eğlence, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
